=== PICO STANDALONE / OFFLINE MODE ===

Server concern only:
  - On Pico heartbeat receipt: server re-sends players_list.
  - players_list: all registered players as {uid, name} list.
  - Pico firmware stores this list in flash (not server's concern).
  - Offline matches are NOT synced back (v1 limitation, document it).

=== STARTUP BEHAVIOR ===

On Flask app startup:
  1. Create/migrate DB schema idempotently.
  2. Enable WAL and foreign keys.
  3. Reset all live_tables.state to "WAITING".
  4. Mark all pico_devices.online = 0.
  5. Start MQTT client (retry with backoff: 1s, 2s, 4s, 30s max).
  6. Subscribe to: tablefootball/#
  7. Start heartbeat watchdog thread (every 5s, PICO_OFFLINE_SEC timeout).
  8. Load live_tables into state.py from DB.
  9. Start SSE broadcast system.

=== ERROR HANDLING ===

  - MQTT disconnect: auto-reconnect with backoff, log WARNING each retry.
  - DB write failure: log ERROR, return 500 HTTP, drop MQTT message.
  - Duplicate GAME_OVER: session_id UNIQUE silently rejects.
  - Same RFID tap from both Picos within 500ms:
      Deduplicate by (uid, table_id, ts) — accept first, drop second.
  - Player rename collision: return 400 with descriptive error message.
  - Admin wrong password: increment attempt counter per IP.
  - Pico offline: LWT received → mark offline → push SSE pico_status.

=== LOGGING ===

  File: logs/server.log (rotating, max 10MB, 5 backups)
  Format: "%(asctime)s %(levelname)s %(module)s: %(message)s"
  INFO:    startup, MQTT connect, GAME_OVER, ABANDONED, registrations
  DEBUG:   every MQTT message (disabled by default)
  WARNING: Pico offline, retries, validation failures, login failures
  ERROR:   DB failures, broker unreachable, exceptions

=== DEPLOYMENT ===

1. scripts/setup_hotspot.sh
   Uses nmcli on Pi OS Bookworm:
     nmcli con add type wifi ifname wlan0 con-name "TableFootball-AP" \
       autoconnect yes ssid "TableFootball"
     nmcli con modify "TableFootball-AP" \
       802-11-wireless.mode ap \
       802-11-wireless-security.key-mgmt wpa-psk \
       802-11-wireless-security.psk "YourPassword" \
       ipv4.method shared \
       ipv4.address 192.168.4.1/24
     nmcli con up "TableFootball-AP"

2. systemd/football.service
   [Unit]
   Description=Table Football Flask Server
   After=network.target mosquitto.service
   Requires=mosquitto.service

   [Service]
   User=pi
   WorkingDirectory=/home/pi/server
   ExecStart=/home/pi/server/venv/bin/python app.py
   Restart=on-failure
   RestartSec=5
   EnvironmentFile=/home/pi/server/.env

   [Install]
   WantedBy=multi-user.target

3. scripts/backup_db.sh
   #!/bin/bash
   DATE=$(date +%Y%m%d_%H%M%S)
   cp /home/pi/server/football.db \
      /home/pi/server/backups/football_$DATE.db
   find /home/pi/server/backups -name "*.db" -mtime +7 -delete

   Crontab: 0 4 * * * /home/pi/server/scripts/backup_db.sh

4. /etc/mosquitto/conf.d/football.conf
   allow_anonymous true
   max_connections 20
   listener 1883 0.0.0.0

